WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,660 --> 00:00:01,560
I know

2
00:00:01,860 --> 00:00:04,500
Why didn't you tell me earlier?

3
00:00:04,780 --> 00:00:06,420
Wen Chen is no ordinary person at first glance

4
00:00:06,420 --> 00:00:07,620
why drive him away

5
00:00:07,620 --> 00:00:09,060
Sujia missed the opportunity in vain

6
00:00:09,060 --> 00:00:10,260
You may have offended him

7
00:00:10,260 --> 00:00:11,540
He didn't even take the college entrance examination

8
00:00:12,020 --> 00:00:13,740
I saw him studying at Zhongzhou University with my own eyes

9
00:00:13,740 --> 00:00:14,780
Where are the unwell parents?

10
00:00:14,780 --> 00:00:16,060
Just get him back

11
00:00:16,060 --> 00:00:17,540
No one is allowed to look for him again

12
00:00:17,540 --> 00:00:18,660
Don't cause trouble

13
00:00:18,900 --> 00:00:21,260
Lingyun Duo invites Ting Feng to come out

14
00:00:21,500 --> 00:00:22,780
Yes grandpa

15
00:00:24,980 --> 00:00:25,900
what is this

16
00:00:25,900 --> 00:00:27,220
There may be arrangements for Wen Shou Xi

17
00:00:27,220 --> 00:00:28,260
This is his special plane

18
00:00:28,260 --> 00:00:29,380
Why the special plane?

19
00:00:29,380 --> 00:00:31,020
Your executors don’t even have a special car.

20
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:33,060
No matter how strong he is, he can't do it in terms of treatment.

21
00:00:33,220 --> 00:00:34,220
So much difference

22
00:00:34,220 --> 00:00:36,500
I don’t seem to have much to do recently.

23
00:00:36,500 --> 00:00:38,340
If there is no mission, use a private plane

24
00:00:38,340 --> 00:00:39,740
It’s taking up public resources

25
00:00:40,500 --> 00:00:42,020
What a coincidence it's you

26
00:00:42,020 --> 00:00:43,660
Wen Shouxi is a private trip, right?

27
00:00:43,660 --> 00:00:45,020
Isn't this a public tool for private use?

28
00:00:45,020 --> 00:00:46,340
What does it have to do with you

29
00:00:46,340 --> 00:00:47,260
train a pilot

30
00:00:47,260 --> 00:00:48,380
consume a lot of resources

31
00:00:48,380 --> 00:00:50,340
Isn’t it a waste to use it to fly a private jet?

32
00:00:50,340 --> 00:00:52,140
This is the opportunity I worked hard for

33
00:00:52,140 --> 00:00:53,340
nothing is wasted
